  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Go away now, traveler. Go and climb this mountain to find our lord there.
      Devout like I am, I hope he will praise you for my merits.
  - speaker: 0
    text: "I wouldn\u2019t be so sure after what I learned here."
  - speaker: 1
    text: Think what you want, pilgrim, but I have always acted only in the interest
      of our God and our church.
